# Thousand Needles (33-34): the Shimmering Flats (the Mirage Raceway and the silithid hive), the
# errands they send you on to Ratchet, the Crossroads, Orgrimmar and Booty Bay, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/thousand_needles_33_34.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Thousand Needles, area 400).
# The quest list is section 14 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md. The Freewind Post and
# Grimtotem quests are in Thousand Needles (28-30).
# Carried in (skipped by those who lack them): Parts for Kravel (1112, from Wharfmaster Dizzywig in
#   Ratchet, after Wharfmaster Dizzywig in Thousand Needles (28-30)) and, for shamans, Call of Water (96, from
#   the Minor Manifestation of Water in Silverpine Forest).
# Left to later guides: The Kolkar of Desolace (1362, after Regthar Deathgate 1361, taken in
#   Orgrimmar and handed in west of the Crossroads) and Family Tree (5361) for Desolace (34-36), Alliance Relations (1432) for
#   Desolace (34-36), Hemet Nesingwary (5762) for Stranglethorn Vale (36-37), Martek the Exiled
#   (1106) for Badlands (39-40), Frostmaw (1136) for Badlands (39-40).
# Left out: the Gnomeregan quests, A Fine Mess (2904), Rig Wars (2841) and Grime-Encrusted Ring
#   (2945): their objectives are inside the dungeon.
# Optional, for a group: The Sparklematic 5200! (2951), a Grime-Encrusted Object from the troggs
#   and Leper Gnomes washed in the machine of the Clean Zone, inside Gnomeregan, which Scooty's
#   transponder reaches from Booty Bay. The other two Sparklematic quests (4601, 4602) are the same
#   one for the Alliance; the guide passes the step for those who did one.
#
# The route: the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and a flight to Freewind Post; the Shimmering Flats, one loop
# around them from the Mirage Raceway; a flight to Ratchet and the Crossroads, then Orgrimmar; the
# zeppelin to Grom'gol for the murlocs of the Vile Reef and the road to Booty Bay; the hearthstone
# to Freewind Post for the last hand-in at the raceway; a flight to Thunder Bluff, where the next
# guide starts.

guide Thousand Needles (33-34)
faction horde
levels 33 34
carry 96 1112 1712 1714 79007
leave 1106 1136 1362 1432 1712 1714 5361 5762 79007
next Desolace (34-36)

# Orgrimmar -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Durotar
note "From the Eastern Kingdoms, take the zeppelin to the tower outside Orgrimmar, then walk into the city" at 50.8,13.4
map Orgrimmar
accept 1146 1361
tip Belgrom Rockmaul stands in the Valley of Honor; he has The Swarm Grows for those who brought him Korran's report on the silithid, and sends you to Regthar Deathgate in the Barrens.
accept 1531
tip Searn Firewarder, in the Valley of Wisdom, sends shamans on to Thousand Needles.
fly "Freewind Post, Thousand Needles" npc 3310
tip No flight path to Freewind Post yet? Fly to Camp Taurajo, ride south through the Great Lift and follow the road to the mesa of Freewind Post.

# Freewind Post ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Thousand Needles
fpath 4317
bind 11116
tip Set your hearthstone here: it brings you back from Booty Bay at the end.
accept 5361
tip Cliffwatcher Longhorn wanders around the post. His quest is for Desolace: keep it, the next guide hands it in.
turnin 1531
tip Prate Cloudseer and Dorn Plainstalker stand together north-east of Freewind Post.

# The Shimmering Flats: the Mirage Raceway -------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 1146
accept 1147
tip Moktar Krin camps on the western edge of the Shimmering Flats, on the way from Freewind Post to the raceway.
turnin 1112
accept 1110 1114 5762
tip Hemet Nesingwary is in Stranglethorn Vale: keep that one, a later guide hands it in.
turnin 1114
accept 1104
accept 1115
tip The Rumormonger is for Booty Bay: you go there later in this guide.
accept 1105
accept 1176
accept 1175
tip Trackmaster Zherin waits at the east end of the raceway's track.

# One loop around the flats ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 1110 bg
tip The Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats: pick it up whenever you pass some.
do 1176 bg
tip Any vulture of the flats can carry the bones; most circle over the south.
do 1175.2 bg
do 1175.1 bg
do 1104 bg
do 1105
tip Ride north from the raceway: the Sparkleshell tortoises crowd the north-east of the flats, and more live on the west side.
do 1175.1
tip The Saltstone Basilisks bask across the north and west of the flats; Crystalhides are among them.
do 1104
tip Any scorpid of the west side drops the venom.
do 1147 bg
accept 1148 at 67.9,86.1 icon get "Kill silithid until one drops a Cracked Silithid Carapace, then open it: it starts a quest"
do 1148 bg
do 1147
tip The silithid hive is in the south-west of the flats: the Searchers outside, the Drones around the mouth, the Invaders deep inside. They call each other for help: pull them one at a time.
do 1148
do 1175.2
do 1175.3
tip The Saltstone Gazers and more Crystalhides are at the southern end of the flats, east of the hive.
do 1176
do 1110

# Back at the raceway --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 1110
turnin 1104
turnin 1105
accept 1107
tip Wizzle wants the fins of the Saltscale murlocs of the Vile Reef, in Stranglethorn Vale: you go there later in this guide.
accept 1106
tip Martek is in the Badlands: keep this one, a later guide hands it in.
turnin 1176
accept 1178
turnin 1175
turnin 1147
tip Moktar Krin is on your way back west.
fly "Ratchet, The Barrens" npc 4317
tip Ride back west to Freewind Post for the flight.

# Ratchet, the Crossroads and Orgrimmar ----------------------------------------------------------------

map The Barrens
turnin 1178
accept 1180
tip Gazlowe is upstairs in the big house in the middle of Ratchet.
turnin 96
tip Islen Waterseer stands on the shore south-east of Ratchet.
fly "Crossroads, The Barrens" npc 16227
turnin 1148
accept 1184
turnin 1361
tip Regthar Deathgate stands at the watch post west of the Crossroads, a short ride along the road toward Stonetalon.
accept 1362
tip Keep it: Desolace (34-36) takes it to Felgur Twocuts at Ghost Walker Post.
fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 3615
map Orgrimmar
turnin 1184
accept 2842
tip Sovik is in the building next to Nogg, in the Valley of Honor; ask him what else he has to say.
accept 1432
tip Keldran walks around in the Valley of Spirits, on the far west side of the city. His quest is for Desolace: keep it.
note "Buy an Elixir of Water Breathing or two at the auction house, for the Vile Reef (optional)" npc 8673
tip The Saltscale murlocs live under the sea: without a way to breathe you must keep coming up for air.
train 3353 3352 3401 6014 3344 5882 3326
map Durotar
note "Take the zeppelin to Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn Vale" npc 12136
tip The zeppelin tower stands in Durotar, a short ride from the gate of Orgrimmar.

# Stranglethorn Vale: the Vile Reef and Booty Bay ------------------------------------------------------

map Stranglethorn Vale
fpath 1387
do 1107
tip The Vile Reef lies under the sea just west of Grom'gol. The Saltscale murlocs are elite: fight them together, and watch your breath.
goto "Follow the road south through the jungle to Booty Bay" at 28.1,74.4 r 25
tip Keep to the road: the trolls and raptors away from it are higher level than you.
fpath 2858
tip Gringer keeps his bats on the balcony at the top of the inn.
turnin 1180
tip Wharfmaster Lozgil stands on the docks at the north of the bay.
turnin 1115
tip Krazek is on the top floor of the inn.
turnin 2842
accept 2843
do 2843 at 27.6,77.4 icon text "Wait by Scooty while he calibrates the Goblin Transponder"
turnin 2843
tip The transponder on Scooty's pad now takes you to the entrance of Gnomeregan, a dungeon, in Dun Morogh.

# Gnomeregan (optional, a dungeon) ---------------------------------------------------------------------

note "Optional, with a group: step onto the Goblin Transponder to teleport to the entrance of Gnomeregan" at 27.6,77.4
tip Gnomeregan is a dungeon for five players of about level 29-38. Not going? Right-click this step and the three after it, then use your hearthstone.
accept 2951 at 24.3,39.8 in Dun_Morogh
tip The Sparklematic 5200 is a cleaning machine in the Clean Zone, inside Gnomeregan, south-west of the round hall near the start: keep to the ramps rather than jumping down. Take its quest when you reach it.
do 2951 at 24.3,39.8 in Dun_Morogh "Inside Gnomeregan, kill the troggs and Leper Gnomes until one drops a Grime-Encrusted Object"
tip The Caverndeep troggs and the irradiated invaders on the way in drop the most: the one you loot on the way down is enough. Each of you needs one.
turnin 2951 at 24.3,39.8 in Dun_Morogh
tip It costs 3 copper per wash and gives a random item for the object you put in.
hearth npc 11116

# Freewind Post, the raceway and Thunder Bluff --------------------------------------------------------

map Thousand Needles
turnin 1107
tip Ride east from Freewind Post back to the raceway on the Shimmering Flats.
fly "Thunder Bluff, Mulgore" npc 4317
tip Ride back to Freewind Post for the flight.
map Thunder Bluff
accept 1136
tip Melor Stonehoof is on Hunter Rise. Frostmaw lives in the Alterac Mountains: keep it, later guides kill him and hand it in.
